{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55218","headline":"遗诗 二 · 卢道者","name":"遗诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"撒手永超三界，一去定无反复。\n（见郑方坤《五代诗话》卷九引《粤西通志》。\n）（〖1〗《粤西通志》云：「卢道者精於卜，後唐同光二年，有郡倅因内孕岁余不产，求卢道者卜之。\n书一『酷』字，遂不踰月二十一日酉时娩。\n倅以爲神，建塔居之。\n後坐化，遗诗云〖略〗。\n末云：〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}